    "description": "Festival International de Cinéma et Mémoire Commune (FICMEC), organized in Nador by the Centre de la Mémoire Commune pour la Démocratie et la Paix, uses film screenings, conferences and workshops to advance transitional justice, human rights and peacebuilding. Each edition explores a distinct theme related to collective memory.",
